    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "CreationAction represents the lifecycle event of Product creation. A product could be manufactured, assembled, mined/extracted directly from the nature etc.\n\nRelationship:\n\nFor each CreateAction there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of 'hasOutput’ on the from and a /Core/Element class or subclass on the to."
